    "description": "# MyGO!!!!! / Ave Mujica / CRYCHIC & Sumimi Album Wallpaper\r\n\r\n以四支乐队音乐为主题的 Wallpaper Engine 动态壁纸，收录原创曲、翻唱曲、动画 TV 版歌曲及部分纯音乐，搭配专辑封面、同步歌词与音乐频谱。\r\n\r\n通过右上角 `BAND` 切换内置曲库。播放器支持顺序、随机、单曲循环及 `Next` 列表，也可切换为可拖动的 mini 播放栏。歌词与歌单面板可拖动、调整大小；歌单和筛选列表支持滚动、拖拽滑块及方向按钮。另有明暗主题、模糊封面背景、封面动效和低占用模式。有歌词的歌曲可选择原文、中文或双语显示；界面支持 10 种语言。\r\n\r\n**导入自己的音乐：**在 Wallpaper Engine 中右键此壁纸，选择“在资源管理器中打开”，再用 Edge 或 Chrome 打开 `diy-importer/album-importer.html`。按提示导入专辑封面、歌曲及可选的 LRC 歌词；重载壁纸后，在 `BAND → DIY` 中播放。请自行备份原始素材。\r\n\r\n**AI 生成内容说明**\r\n\r\n- 部分自制 `Cover` 与 `Others` 专辑封面使用 AI 图像生成工具制作。\r\n- 壁纸界面设计、前端实现、播放器交互、歌词解析与资源整理由作者主导，并在 AI 协助下开发与调整。\r\n\r\n播放器交互灵感来自 [OriginalCube 的《Bocchi the Rock!》专辑壁纸](https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2905017768)。部分矢量 Logo 素材由[月睢 Rausay](https://space.bilibili.com/82372299)整理或重绘，遵循 CC BY 4.0。音乐、歌词及官方素材版权归各自权利人所有。本作为非官方、非商业同人作品。\r\n\r\n\r\n本次更新内容 20260925\r\n- 新增 6 首翻唱／歌曲及对应的单曲封面：MyGO!!!!! 的《青春コンプレックス》《シャルル》《ないものねだり》加入 Cover；Ave Mujica 的《残酷な天使のテーゼ》《Abracadabra》加入 Cover，《A Song Of Romance》加入 Others。其中《A Song Of Romance》配有同步歌词；原有歌曲的封面配置保持不变。\r\n- 新增可拖动的 mini 播放栏，可一键切回完整模式。mini 版保留播放模式、切歌、播放暂停、进度和音量控制，并记住拖动位置。\r\n- 导入器增加首次选择壁纸文件夹时的错误提示：如果浏览器弹出“无法开启这个资料夹”，可在同一页面重新选择一次。\r\n---\r\n\r\n# MyGO!!!!! / Ave Mujica / CRYCHIC & Sumimi Album Wallpaper\r\n\r\nA Wallpaper Engine web wallpaper featuring music from MyGO!!!!!, Ave Mujica, CRYCHIC and Sumimi. It includes original songs, covers, TV versions and some instrumentals, alongside album art, synchronized lyrics and an audio visualizer.\r\n\r\nUse the `BAND` menu to switch between the built-in libraries. The player supports sequential play, shuffle, repeat-one and a `Next` queue, plus a draggable mini mode. The lyrics and playlist panels can be moved and resized. Playlist and filter lists support scrolling, draggable scrollbars and direction buttons. Light and dark themes, blurred cover backgrounds, cover animations and a low-usage mode are also available. Songs with lyrics can display the original text, Chinese translation or both. The interface supports 10 languages.\r\n\r\n**Add your own music:** Right-click this wallpaper in Wallpaper Engine and choose “Open in Explorer.” Open `diy-importer/album-importer.html` in Edge or Chrome, then follow the instructions to import an album cover, audio files and optional LRC lyrics. Reload the wallpaper to find your music under `BAND → DIY`. Please keep backups of your original files.\r\n\r\n**AI-generated content**\r\n\r\n- Some custom `Cover` and `Others` album covers were made with AI image-generation tools.\r\n- The wallpaper’s visual design, frontend, player interactions, lyric parsing and asset organization were led by the author, with AI assistance during development and refinement.\r\n\r\nThe player interaction was inspired by [OriginalCube’s *Bocchi the Rock!* album-player wallpaper](https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2905017768). Some vector logos were compiled or redrawn by [Rausay](https://space.bilibili.com/82372299) under CC BY 4.0. Music, lyrics and official artwork remain the property of their respective rights holders. This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan work.\r\n\r\n\r\nUpdate Notes 20260925\r\n- Added six songs with individual cover art. MyGO!!!!!’s “青春コンプレックス,” “シャルル” and “ないものねだり” are in Cover. Ave Mujica’s “残酷な天使のテーゼ” and “Abracadabra” are in Cover, while “A Song Of Romance” is in Others. “A Song Of Romance” includes synchronized lyrics. Existing songs keep their previous cover settings.\r\n- Added a draggable mini player with a one-click return to the full player. It retains playback mode, track controls, seeking and volume, and remembers its position.\r\n- Added guidance for a browser error that may appear when selecting the wallpaper folder for the first time: if the folder cannot be opened, select the same folder again without closing the importer.",
